<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
    PLACEHOLDER — Replace this file with the real GoogleService-Info.plist downloaded from:
    Firebase Console → Project Settings → iOS app → Download GoogleService-Info.plist

    Required fields:
    - BUNDLE_ID (com.ruvo.app)
    - API_KEY
    - GCM_SENDER_ID
    - GOOGLE_APP_ID
    - PROJECT_ID (ruvo-app or similar)
    - STORAGE_BUCKET
    - REVERSED_CLIENT_ID (add to Info.plist CFBundleURLSchemes)

    After downloading:
    1. Rename to GoogleService-Info.plist
    2. Add to Xcode project (check "Copy items if needed")
    3. Add REVERSED_CLIENT_ID value to Info.plist CFBundleURLSchemes array
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
